    <div class="content-section">
      <h2>About the Committee</h2>
      <p>The Area 75 Literature Committee concerns itself with both General Service Approved and A.A. Service literature — printed, web, audio, and audiovisual works. We use a round-the-table format to share our experience, strength, and hope on carrying AA's message through its literature.</p>
      <p>As Bill W. wrote after 25 years of AA: our message would have become hopelessly garbled if transmitted only by word of mouth. Literature keeps the message clear.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="content-section">
